    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Leading data analysts Raynor and Ahmed conducted a five-year study to sort through mountains of data and identify 18 companies who have truly exceptional lifetime performance. They found that success derives from how executives make choices around three key areas: price, position, and persistence. The Three Rules will allow leaders in organizations of any kind to make the hard choices that drive long-term success. When the pressure is on and the facts are ambiguous, you need to know what works most often for the most successful companies.</marc:subfield>
